(5916747, 862313, 23317, '<td valign="top">Of the moving train photos, this was my favorite.  I like that the image makes me determine that I''m in the subject of the image.  I also like the lone walker at the far end of the station.  9 from me.</td>', 'Of the moving train photos, this was my favorite.  I like that the image makes me determine that I''m in the subject of the image.  I also like the lone walker at the far end of the station.  9 from me.', '2010-03-24 22:02:56.000000', NULL, 1),
