(5917511, 862461, 96881, '<td valign="top">Not sure of the title (aircraft should be rotated for that one) but then again, I avoid bug-smashes.........<br/>Clean crisp image that is well exposed......<br/> <br/>But it does lack any wow factor.........Plane is on final but just blue and centered.  there lacks any real dynamic aspect here to make it stand out</td>', 'Not sure of the title (aircraft should be rotated for that one) but then again, I avoid bug-smashes.........Clean crisp image that is well exposed...... But it does lack any wow factor.........Plane is on final but just blue and centered.  there lacks any real dynamic aspect here to make it stand out', '2010-03-25 18:12:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5917514, 862299, 96881, '<td valign="top">Normally, borders don''t affect me, but this one does.......The red has no connection to the image and just looks out of place<br/> <br/>Other than that, the image of the badge is alright, but the composition really seems a little boring.  Something more dramatic, rather than the centred badge, would have worked better</td>', 'Normally, borders don''t affect me, but this one does.......The red has no connection to the image and just looks out of place Other than that, the image of the badge is alright, but the composition really seems a little boring.  Something more dramatic, rather than the centred badge, would have worked better', '2010-03-25 18:15:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5917581, 862565, 79816, '<td valign="top">Great Truck!<br/> <br/>Your file size is large, but the image seems to have suffered badly from compression. Perhaps take a look at some of the resizing tutorials around.<br/> <br/>A slight horizon correction would help as well, I feel the image is leaning a little down to the left.</td>', 'Great Truck! Your file size is large, but the image seems to have suffered badly from compression. Perhaps take a look at some of the resizing tutorials around. A slight horizon correction would help as well, I feel the image is leaning a little down to the left.', '2010-03-25 19:28:08.000000', NULL, 1),
