(5917772, 862655, 83313, '<td valign="top">Considering the one in the back is probably a fighter, I don''t think the C-17 will need to hold up much. (Or is that a paratrooper that just jumped out?)  There is a blob of sensor crud toward the top of the frame that is ok to clone out under basic rules.</td>', 'Considering the one in the back is probably a fighter, I don''t think the C-17 will need to hold up much. (Or is that a paratrooper that just jumped out?)  There is a blob of sensor crud toward the top of the frame that is ok to clone out under basic rules.', '2010-03-25 22:52:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5917775, 862306, 83313, '<td valign="top">I''m going to hazard a guess that this might be a <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=50695" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Posthumous</a> entry, though there are a few other likely suspects as well. Looks like it could be the underside of a car. Maybe. Or a strange plane-like thingy. Not really sure what it is, but I don''t think I was supposed to really know. I''m now thinking too hard and it hurts.</td>', 'I''m going to hazard a guess that this might be a  Posthumous entry, though there are a few other likely suspects as well. Looks like it could be the underside of a car. Maybe. Or a strange plane-like thingy. Not really sure what it is, but I don''t think I was supposed to really know. I''m now thinking too hard and it hurts.', '2010-03-25 22:55:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5917776, 862509, 83313, '<td valign="top">There is a telltale grayness to this that indicates you may have tried too hard to pull in some detail from the blown highlights, and there was nothing there to pull in. It hurt the clarity of the rest of the image, however. Midday sun is a very difficult light in which to take photos, for reasons such as this.</td>', 'There is a telltale grayness to this that indicates you may have tried too hard to pull in some detail from the blown highlights, and there was nothing there to pull in. It hurt the clarity of the rest of the image, however. Midday sun is a very difficult light in which to take photos, for reasons such as this.', '2010-03-25 22:59:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5917777, 862624, 83313, '<td valign="top">I love these old rusty-crusties. Nice treatment on this one.</td>', 'I love these old rusty-crusties. Nice treatment on this one.', '2010-03-25 22:59:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5917779, 862461, 83313, '<td valign="top">Calm!? You ask Grog stay calm for flying monster attack!?  Grog will attack! Grog see weakness. Will stab soft underbelly with spear. Is good strong spear, made from scales of <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=861249" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">other monster</a>. Other monster fell to Grog and so will flying one. Grog is great warrior!!!!</td>', 'Calm!? You ask Grog stay calm for flying monster attack!?  Grog will attack! Grog see weakness. Will stab soft underbelly with spear. Is good strong spear, made from scales of other monster. Other monster fell to Grog and so will flying one. Grog is great warrior!!!!', '2010-03-25 23:06:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5917781, 861713, 83313, '<td valign="top">Haha! Thag call Grog fool for hunting in city. Thag is fool! Grog has found food for tribe. Grog find mammoth to feed tribe during cold time. Tiger have tough meat, but sharp fangs to make weapon. Squirrel-thing has no meat, but will make fun for children of Grog to chase, so can become great hunter like Grog one day!</td>', 'Haha! Thag call Grog fool for hunting in city. Thag is fool! Grog has found food for tribe. Grog find mammoth to feed tribe during cold time. Tiger have tough meat, but sharp fangs to make weapon. Squirrel-thing has no meat, but will make fun for children of Grog to chase, so can become great hunter like Grog one day!', '2010-03-25 23:13:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5917784, 862310, 83313, '<td valign="top">I wanted to shoot the steam engine we have here that runs from the Ft. Worth Stockyards. It''s been out of commission for a while and was supposed to be back on the rails this past weekend. The weather really sucked that day and the photos would have been poor anyway, so I aborted my plans. I see things worked out much better for you. Nice looking train.</td>', 'I wanted to shoot the steam engine we have here that runs from the Ft. Worth Stockyards. It''s been out of commission for a while and was supposed to be back on the rails this past weekend. The weather really sucked that day and the photos would have been poor anyway, so I aborted my plans. I see things worked out much better for you. Nice looking train.', '2010-03-25 23:17:13.000000', NULL, 1),
