(5918400, 862672, 83686, '<td valign="top">I like the PP on this, gives it a gritty feel...I also like the way the tail of the plane in the foreground frames the plane in the background. Wish I had thought about this idea because we live very close to a airbase that has a similar static display. Well done, I''m just guessing this is <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=83313" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Yo_Spiff</a>.</td>', 'I like the PP on this, gives it a gritty feel...I also like the way the tail of the plane in the foreground frames the plane in the background. Wish I had thought about this idea because we live very close to a airbase that has a similar static display. Well done, I''m just guessing this is  Yo_Spiff.', '2010-03-26 15:06:21.000000', NULL, 1),
