(5918443, 862069, 10785, '<td valign="top">It may be true that you took this picture on the person''s prom day, but there is nothing in the photo that gives a hint of this to the viewer. So here the title doesn''t add anything to the picture. It''s a good picture in that it has good color and saturation and it''s in focus, but there is nothing interesting about the composition. There was no interesting point of view, no leading lines, no stop action of a water splash, no motion blur of people having a water fight. So I don''t want to be harsh in my criticism, but here is an example of a good and average picture.</td>', 'It may be true that you took this picture on the person''s prom day, but there is nothing in the photo that gives a hint of this to the viewer. So here the title doesn''t add anything to the picture. It''s a good picture in that it has good color and saturation and it''s in focus, but there is nothing interesting about the composition. There was no interesting point of view, no leading lines, no stop action of a water splash, no motion blur of people having a water fight. So I don''t want to be harsh in my criticism, but here is an example of a good and average picture.', '2010-03-26 15:33:59.000000', NULL, 1),
