(5918817, 862616, 115345, '<td valign="top">it''s a good photo, you have done well to capture it as you have but for me the downfall is it is a little cliche''d.  Not sure how to get around that but it seems  much like many magazine shots of vehicles (which is good if you want to get published in magazines!) but it doesn''t stand out as a ''special'' shot for me - sorry. Maybe if there was a human figure in there somewhere it might of lifted it?  Not sure.<br/> <br/>That is not to say it is a bad photo - it is well done.</td>', 'it''s a good photo, you have done well to capture it as you have but for me the downfall is it is a little cliche''d.  Not sure how to get around that but it seems  much like many magazine shots of vehicles (which is good if you want to get published in magazines!) but it doesn''t stand out as a ''special'' shot for me - sorry. Maybe if there was a human figure in there somewhere it might of lifted it?  Not sure. That is not to say it is a bad photo - it is well done.', '2010-03-27 02:20:45.000000', NULL, 1),
