(5918819, 862551, 115345, '<td valign="top">Love the colours and atmosphere of this shot.  The gradual curve of the train and general composition make this a really strong image.  I like how the tree and sun balance the cab on the right.  Only one minor criticism is the vertical pole to the right of the engine - maybe shot a second later may have made this bit cleaner? but that is a minor quibble about an image I''d be proud of as it is.</td>', 'Love the colours and atmosphere of this shot.  The gradual curve of the train and general composition make this a really strong image.  I like how the tree and sun balance the cab on the right.  Only one minor criticism is the vertical pole to the right of the engine - maybe shot a second later may have made this bit cleaner? but that is a minor quibble about an image I''d be proud of as it is.', '2010-03-27 02:21:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5918820, 862488, 115345, '<td valign="top">great shot!  has it all - good composition, well balanced, interesting subject, technically well executed - very impressive!</td>', 'great shot!  has it all - good composition, well balanced, interesting subject, technically well executed - very impressive!', '2010-03-27 02:21:57.000000', NULL, 1),
