(5918827, 861875, 115345, '<td valign="top">I like this - interesting viewpoint, draws you in, I like the horizontal lines in the reflection bending to give form to the vehicle shape.  Maybe a higher crop perhaps but that is just me - I find the wheel at the bottom left slightly detracts.  Still a good image</td>', 'I like this - interesting viewpoint, draws you in, I like the horizontal lines in the reflection bending to give form to the vehicle shape.  Maybe a higher crop perhaps but that is just me - I find the wheel at the bottom left slightly detracts.  Still a good image', '2010-03-27 02:22:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5918828, 862473, 115345, '<td valign="top">good image - love the evocative colours and atmosphere</td>', 'good image - love the evocative colours and atmosphere', '2010-03-27 02:22:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5918829, 862560, 115345, '<td valign="top">I like this - the way you have composed this and captured the texture and pattern of the trees and the colours really make what could of been a rather plain shot something special.</td>', 'I like this - the way you have composed this and captured the texture and pattern of the trees and the colours really make what could of been a rather plain shot something special.', '2010-03-27 02:22:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5918830, 862681, 115345, '<td valign="top">this is good - it is not cliche''d it captures an atmosphere really well, love how the aircraft is balanced by the tree branches - well done!</td>', 'this is good - it is not cliche''d it captures an atmosphere really well, love how the aircraft is balanced by the tree branches - well done!', '2010-03-27 02:22:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5918831, 862489, 115345, '<td valign="top">I like this image.  The muted colours, angle and background add an almost abstract feel but don''t detract from the subject.</td>', 'I like this image.  The muted colours, angle and background add an almost abstract feel but don''t detract from the subject.', '2010-03-27 02:22:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5918832, 861835, 115345, '<td valign="top">Very elegant composition, I like the colours but possibly the darkness of under the left roadway(?) is distracting.  It slightly unbalances the image for me but otherwise I think this a really good image</td>', 'Very elegant composition, I like the colours but possibly the darkness of under the left roadway(?) is distracting.  It slightly unbalances the image for me but otherwise I think this a really good image', '2010-03-27 02:22:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5918833, 862535, 115345, '<td valign="top">I like the image and viewpoint, the reflected images off the canopy and the cumulus building up in the background really make it more than a standard ''competent'' image into something ''interesting''.  Cool</td>', 'I like the image and viewpoint, the reflected images off the canopy and the cumulus building up in the background really make it more than a standard ''competent'' image into something ''interesting''.  Cool', '2010-03-27 02:23:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5918834, 862051, 115345, '<td valign="top">I like this - good colours and composition, I think the aircraft at the right balances the wharf area at the left well.</td>', 'I like this - good colours and composition, I think the aircraft at the right balances the wharf area at the left well.', '2010-03-27 02:23:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5918835, 862461, 115345, '<td valign="top">good image and composition is right and technically seems all fine but (as I''ve commented on several other entries), I find it a bit of a stock aircraft image - that said I have an aviation background and may have been exposed to more of this type of image so I may be jaded - sorry!</td>', 'good image and composition is right and technically seems all fine but (as I''ve commented on several other entries), I find it a bit of a stock aircraft image - that said I have an aviation background and may have been exposed to more of this type of image so I may be jaded - sorry!', '2010-03-27 02:23:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5918836, 862646, 115345, '<td valign="top">Ineresting balanced composition, I like the abstract feel and the sun reflection is well done.</td>', 'Ineresting balanced composition, I like the abstract feel and the sun reflection is well done.', '2010-03-27 02:23:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5918837, 862534, 115345, '<td valign="top">good composition, the approach lighting framing the aircraft and the sky colouration _raises this above a standard cliche''d shot.  A pleasing image</td>', 'good composition, the approach lighting framing the aircraft and the sky colouration _raises this above a standard cliche''d shot.  A pleasing image', '2010-03-27 02:23:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5918838, 862189, 115345, '<td valign="top">I like this - what could have been an ordinary shot has turned out something special - the colours, sunlight, clouds - all well captured and atmospheric.  Cool</td>', 'I like this - what could have been an ordinary shot has turned out something special - the colours, sunlight, clouds - all well captured and atmospheric.  Cool', '2010-03-27 02:23:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5918839, 862399, 115345, '<td valign="top">I like the detail and focus you have got here - not an easy task given the subject matter.  Composition good too.</td>', 'I like the detail and focus you have got here - not an easy task given the subject matter.  Composition good too.', '2010-03-27 02:23:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5918840, 862312, 115345, '<td valign="top">Interesting image.  I wonder if you had a polarising filter it may have made the interior of the tuk tuk become more of a focus? (that is not a criticism just an observation).  I find the vertical column with the writing and the bit of car you can see beyond that unbalances and distracts the composition slightly.  Perhaps a slightly different viewpoint could have made this a really top shot?</td>', 'Interesting image.  I wonder if you had a polarising filter it may have made the interior of the tuk tuk become more of a focus? (that is not a criticism just an observation).  I find the vertical column with the writing and the bit of car you can see beyond that unbalances and distracts the composition slightly.  Perhaps a slightly different viewpoint could have made this a really top shot?', '2010-03-27 02:23:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5918841, 862482, 115345, '<td valign="top">this is a very well done shot and it would sit well in a product brochure (do Roll''s have brochures?) but... that is it''s weakness for me - it looks very slick and polished but... ultimately - I find it uninteresting.  Now if there was a bug crawling on the bonnet that would have made it something really attention grabbing and out of the ordinary.  Then again that is just my taste!</td>', 'this is a very well done shot and it would sit well in a product brochure (do Roll''s have brochures?) but... that is it''s weakness for me - it looks very slick and polished but... ultimately - I find it uninteresting.  Now if there was a bug crawling on the bonnet that would have made it something really attention grabbing and out of the ordinary.  Then again that is just my taste!', '2010-03-27 02:23:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5918842, 862163, 115345, '<td valign="top">It almost works for me.  Not sure how you could have done it differently but I find the headlight the main focus and  being slap bang in the middle kind of overpowering.  Also the number plate needs something to balance it.  All that though is just my taste and I am no guru in that department.  The image is well shot and I like the abstract feel.</td>', 'It almost works for me.  Not sure how you could have done it differently but I find the headlight the main focus and  being slap bang in the middle kind of overpowering.  Also the number plate needs something to balance it.  All that though is just my taste and I am no guru in that department.  The image is well shot and I like the abstract feel.', '2010-03-27 02:23:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5918843, 861459, 115345, '<td valign="top">the photo captures the size of the aircraft against that of the towering cumulus but I reckon it would be even better if the aircraft was not centred in the frame.  Still I like it.</td>', 'the photo captures the size of the aircraft against that of the towering cumulus but I reckon it would be even better if the aircraft was not centred in the frame.  Still I like it.', '2010-03-27 02:23:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5918844, 862639, 115345, '<td valign="top">I like he strong colours but the lack of demarcation (and loss of detail) of the rear of the car where it is in front of the trunk of the tree I find distracting.  Also the wire(?) at the top has same distracting effect.<br/> <br/>Otherwise quite like it''s boldness</td>', 'I like he strong colours but the lack of demarcation (and loss of detail) of the rear of the car where it is in front of the trunk of the tree I find distracting.  Also the wire(?) at the top has same distracting effect. Otherwise quite like it''s boldness', '2010-03-27 02:23:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5918845, 861840, 115345, '<td valign="top">Technically fine image and composed well.  Problem is it seems to me a bit of a ''standard'' shot though (or I may be jaded - I have a background in aviation that may have made me see too many of these type of images).  The reflections of the terminal and tarmac activity almost make it something more but don''t quite stand out enough to grab attention.</td>', 'Technically fine image and composed well.  Problem is it seems to me a bit of a ''standard'' shot though (or I may be jaded - I have a background in aviation that may have made me see too many of these type of images).  The reflections of the terminal and tarmac activity almost make it something more but don''t quite stand out enough to grab attention.', '2010-03-27 02:23:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5918846, 862509, 115345, '<td valign="top">It almost works for me... imaginative angle and eye but it doesn''t quite work - not sure why but perhaps the lack of uniformity (something I doubt you could control) is distracting but unfortunately reduces the impact of the image.  I still think worth the shot though</td>', 'It almost works for me... imaginative angle and eye but it doesn''t quite work - not sure why but perhaps the lack of uniformity (something I doubt you could control) is distracting but unfortunately reduces the impact of the image.  I still think worth the shot though', '2010-03-27 02:23:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5918847, 862671, 115345, '<td valign="top">technically good shot but seems a bit of a ''stock'' image - competently done and great for a magazine shot filler image but not one that jumps out as the main photo.</td>', 'technically good shot but seems a bit of a ''stock'' image - competently done and great for a magazine shot filler image but not one that jumps out as the main photo.', '2010-03-27 02:23:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5918848, 862298, 115345, '<td valign="top">technically good but kind of flat.  For me if the main focus of the image is placed in the centreline of the image I prefer very high degree of symmetry - it has to be exact centre and balanced symmetrically.  I wonder if you had taken this from a different vantage you may have captured the sweep of the train back around the corner (I like curves!) and could of balanced the long ''tail'' of the train on the right with the large cab on the left of the image  This just my taste though.</td>', 'technically good but kind of flat.  For me if the main focus of the image is placed in the centreline of the image I prefer very high degree of symmetry - it has to be exact centre and balanced symmetrically.  I wonder if you had taken this from a different vantage you may have captured the sweep of the train back around the corner (I like curves!) and could of balanced the long ''tail'' of the train on the right with the large cab on the left of the image  This just my taste though.', '2010-03-27 02:24:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5918849, 862428, 115345, '<td valign="top">a good image but unfortunately it just doesn''t grab me as interesting... sorry!</td>', 'a good image but unfortunately it just doesn''t grab me as interesting... sorry!', '2010-03-27 02:24:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5918850, 862141, 115345, '<td valign="top">good composition but doesn''t quite grab me - I come from an aviation background which may make me a bit jaded but to me it is a fairly ''stock'' image and a bit of a cliche (then again that may just be me).</td>', 'good composition but doesn''t quite grab me - I come from an aviation background which may make me a bit jaded but to me it is a fairly ''stock'' image and a bit of a cliche (then again that may just be me).', '2010-03-27 02:24:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5918851, 862069, 115345, '<td valign="top">I like colours but the composition grates for me.  Perhaps shot from a different angle rather than pretty much putting the fellow almost in the middle of the shot would make it a more interesting photo</td>', 'I like colours but the composition grates for me.  Perhaps shot from a different angle rather than pretty much putting the fellow almost in the middle of the shot would make it a more interesting photo', '2010-03-27 02:24:13.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(5918852, 861997, 115345, '<td valign="top">doesn''t grab me... I think the shed at the right kind of confuses and complicates the image, sorry.  I like the rails in the foreground though, colours, shape and texture quite cool - wondering if with some creative cropping you could make a more visually grabbing image?</td>', 'doesn''t grab me... I think the shed at the right kind of confuses and complicates the image, sorry.  I like the rails in the foreground though, colours, shape and texture quite cool - wondering if with some creative cropping you could make a more visually grabbing image?', '2010-03-27 02:24:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5918854, 862114, 115345, '<td valign="top">you have done a good job to pan with the car to get great sense of movement.  For me though it needs something more otherwise it is just another picture of a moving car - there isn''t an ''angle'' or thing that really grabs my attention.  Well captured though.</td>', 'you have done a good job to pan with the car to get great sense of movement.  For me though it needs something more otherwise it is just another picture of a moving car - there isn''t an ''angle'' or thing that really grabs my attention.  Well captured though.', '2010-03-27 02:26:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5918856, 862679, 115345, '<td valign="top">interesting composition and colour, pleasing to look at</td>', 'interesting composition and colour, pleasing to look at', '2010-03-27 02:26:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5918859, 862586, 115345, '<td valign="top">Well executed - focus and depth of field but perhaps composition is to cluttered with background.  Wonder how this would have looked set say on an area of deserted road rather than with walls, garden, roof etc in the background.</td>', 'Well executed - focus and depth of field but perhaps composition is to cluttered with background.  Wonder how this would have looked set say on an area of deserted road rather than with walls, garden, roof etc in the background.', '2010-03-27 02:28:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5918863, 862594, 115345, '<td valign="top">I like this - captures an atmosphere, the sun on the boy''s hair is a great highlight.  Pity about the Piper he obscures with his right shoulder, it is distracting.  Maybe if you had a chance to get a slightly different angle on this it may have hidden it... but then may have missed the sunlight.  Still I like it.</td>', 'I like this - captures an atmosphere, the sun on the boy''s hair is a great highlight.  Pity about the Piper he obscures with his right shoulder, it is distracting.  Maybe if you had a chance to get a slightly different angle on this it may have hidden it... but then may have missed the sunlight.  Still I like it.', '2010-03-27 02:31:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5918977, 862535, 98339, '<td valign="top">Do I want to know how you did this???</td>', 'Do I want to know how you did this???', '2010-03-27 09:21:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5918979, 861597, 98339, '<td valign="top">that''s really cute...made me laugh</td>', 'that''s really cute...made me laugh', '2010-03-27 09:22:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5918996, 862313, 37845, '<td valign="top">Ewww... yuck... you call this a photo?  Who would dare to take such rubbish?</td>', 'Ewww... yuck... you call this a photo?  Who would dare to take such rubbish?', '2010-03-27 10:06:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5918997, 862051, 37845, '<td valign="top">Whoa.. this photo was a bit of a trick :)<br/> <br/>I kept looking in the foreground for a boat for some reason, and kept thinking, there are no vehicles in this shot at all.... then, the plane flies right in :)<br/> <br/>Cool use of a fisheye. 7</td>', 'Whoa.. this photo was a bit of a trick :) I kept looking in the foreground for a boat for some reason, and kept thinking, there are no vehicles in this shot at all.... then, the plane flies right in :) Cool use of a fisheye. 7', '2010-03-27 10:08:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5918998, 862672, 37845, '<td valign="top">Looks almost like an HDR shot (or maybe some topaz). I like the textures it leaves on the planes themselves. Gread DOF too, good sharpness on all the important stuff in this shot.</td>', 'Looks almost like an HDR shot (or maybe some topaz). I like the textures it leaves on the planes themselves. Gread DOF too, good sharpness on all the important stuff in this shot.', '2010-03-27 10:10:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5919000, 862603, 37845, '<td valign="top">Decent shot of this train, although I think its a bit tightly cropped on the left.</td>', 'Decent shot of this train, although I think its a bit tightly cropped on the left.', '2010-03-27 10:11:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5919076, 862545, 106910, '<td valign="top">I think BMW would like this pic</td>', 'I think BMW would like this pic', '2010-03-27 12:33:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5919077, 862189, 106910, '<td valign="top">This is giving me inspiration to get the window seat the next time I fly</td>', 'This is giving me inspiration to get the window seat the next time I fly', '2010-03-27 12:33:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5919078, 862684, 106910, '<td valign="top">I love the details</td>', 'I love the details', '2010-03-27 12:34:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5919079, 862535, 106910, '<td valign="top">Awesome perspective</td>', 'Awesome perspective', '2010-03-27 12:34:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5919080, 861835, 106910, '<td valign="top">Simple - but so interesting.</td>', 'Simple - but so interesting.', '2010-03-27 12:34:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5919081, 862344, 106910, '<td valign="top">The monochrome does this justice. Only thing I dislike is how the birds on the side almost get absorbed into the plane behind them. Otherwise - awesome shot.</td>', 'The monochrome does this justice. Only thing I dislike is how the birds on the side almost get absorbed into the plane behind them. Otherwise - awesome shot.', '2010-03-27 12:36:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5919082, 862560, 106910, '<td valign="top">I really like this - the colors, slant, and textures.</td>', 'I really like this - the colors, slant, and textures.', '2010-03-27 12:37:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5919083, 862080, 106910, '<td valign="top">Personal preference - I think a little more contrast would have caused everything to pop out more. There also appears to be a blurry patch on the right that''s distracting me.</td>', 'Personal preference - I think a little more contrast would have caused everything to pop out more. There also appears to be a blurry patch on the right that''s distracting me.', '2010-03-27 12:38:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5919085, 861658, 106910, '<td valign="top">hah clever</td>', 'hah clever', '2010-03-27 12:39:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5919093, 861597, 28427, '<td valign="top">Well found :-)</td>', 'Well found :-)', '2010-03-27 12:48:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5919094, 862624, 28427, '<td valign="top">Great contrast</td>', 'Great contrast', '2010-03-27 12:49:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5919099, 862672, 554, '<td valign="top">Yo?</td>', 'Yo?', '2010-03-27 12:53:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5919104, 862655, 28427, '<td valign="top">Beautiful blue sky and well seen with the 2 plains.  (Think your censor can use a little cleaning -&gt; spot in the middle at the top).</td>', 'Beautiful blue sky and well seen with the 2 plains.  (Think your censor can use a little cleaning -> spot in the middle at the top).', '2010-03-27 12:55:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5919142, 862539, 28427, '<td valign="top">Definitely both!! I wouldn''t be able to walk away from it.</td>', 'Definitely both!! I wouldn''t be able to walk away from it.', '2010-03-27 14:19:57.000000', NULL, 1),
