(5919583, 862305, 42181, '<td valign="top">Good looking shot, i''m loving the guy on the left. You can see him thinking "i just wish this journey was over"</td>', 'Good looking shot, i''m loving the guy on the left. You can see him thinking "i just wish this journey was over"', '2010-03-28 07:50:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5919597, 862684, 89250, '<td valign="top">Though the train, being the subject of the competition, is not seen clearly in this picture, the colourful light trails tell the story. The wet look of the platform ground with reflections of the lighting complements the light trails of the train. The low angle approach (I believe the camera was at or beneath the waist) put the light trails at the upper left of the photo drawing reader''s attention towards the back of the train.</td>', 'Though the train, being the subject of the competition, is not seen clearly in this picture, the colourful light trails tell the story. The wet look of the platform ground with reflections of the lighting complements the light trails of the train. The low angle approach (I believe the camera was at or beneath the waist) put the light trails at the upper left of the photo drawing reader''s attention towards the back of the train.', '2010-03-28 09:01:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5919607, 862104, 15711, '<td valign="top">Looks like a kid''s toy doesn''t it?  I''m not really into the modified cars, but that cherry red is DA BOMB!!</td>', 'Looks like a kid''s toy doesn''t it?  I''m not really into the modified cars, but that cherry red is DA BOMB!!', '2010-03-28 09:34:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5919608, 861979, 15711, '<td valign="top">HEE HEE - this reminds me of a friend''s beloved Australian Shepherd who was taught to "drive" a car in a commercial for a local bank. After the shoot was over, he''d run and jump into the driver''s seat and put his paw on the gear shift!!  I love this dog''s intense gaze - wonder what he''s spotting. Thanks for making me think of her Teddy, who has since crossed over. :) 7</td>', 'HEE HEE - this reminds me of a friend''s beloved Australian Shepherd who was taught to "drive" a car in a commercial for a local bank. After the shoot was over, he''d run and jump into the driver''s seat and put his paw on the gear shift!!  I love this dog''s intense gaze - wonder what he''s spotting. Thanks for making me think of her Teddy, who has since crossed over. :) 7', '2010-03-28 09:36:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5919610, 862080, 15711, '<td valign="top">Straight out of an old western.  Maybe it needs a taller smoke stack, but the sepia really makes it look nostalgic.</td>', 'Straight out of an old western.  Maybe it needs a taller smoke stack, but the sepia really makes it look nostalgic.', '2010-03-28 09:36:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5919611, 862163, 15711, '<td valign="top">I love close ups of old cars.</td>', 'I love close ups of old cars.', '2010-03-28 09:36:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5919612, 862509, 15711, '<td valign="top">Having worked in the car business, I remember situations like this in the Texas heat, with me wearing panty hose, and nearly fainting from the temperatures coming off of the asphalt and metal. This has a certain abstract beauty to it.</td>', 'Having worked in the car business, I remember situations like this in the Texas heat, with me wearing panty hose, and nearly fainting from the temperatures coming off of the asphalt and metal. This has a certain abstract beauty to it.', '2010-03-28 09:38:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5919613, 862310, 15711, '<td valign="top">Love the red "bumper." This would be cool in a sepia duotone as well. ALL ABOARD!!</td>', 'Love the red "bumper." This would be cool in a sepia duotone as well. ALL ABOARD!!', '2010-03-28 09:38:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5919614, 862473, 15711, '<td valign="top">I''m trying to figure out what is on the hood.  It almost looks like a bird flapping its wings.  I like the grungy feel of it.  They don''t make beasts like this any more. I like how the truck is slightly off kilter, which adds to the sense of decay and abandonment.</td>', 'I''m trying to figure out what is on the hood.  It almost looks like a bird flapping its wings.  I like the grungy feel of it.  They don''t make beasts like this any more. I like how the truck is slightly off kilter, which adds to the sense of decay and abandonment.', '2010-03-28 09:39:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5919617, 862189, 15711, '<td valign="top">That''s awesome.  Don''t you love looking out of the window as you descend and take off?  Even though the highlights are blown out, this has a perfect division of horizontal thirds.  The cloud pink gray section, the blue (I like how the horizon cuts the image in half which is another way of looking at it) and the lower green part. They gradate into one another so beautifully.  Nicely done.</td>', 'That''s awesome.  Don''t you love looking out of the window as you descend and take off?  Even though the highlights are blown out, this has a perfect division of horizontal thirds.  The cloud pink gray section, the blue (I like how the horizon cuts the image in half which is another way of looking at it) and the lower green part. They gradate into one another so beautifully.  Nicely done.', '2010-03-28 09:42:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5919618, 862312, 15711, '<td valign="top">The red writing on the right makes this centered image more interesting.  Nice.</td>', 'The red writing on the right makes this centered image more interesting.  Nice.', '2010-03-28 09:42:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5919620, 862529, 15711, '<td valign="top">I used to love being able to go out to the gate and greet your arriving passengers.  Nice shot.  Looks like a brochure photo for the airport. :)</td>', 'I used to love being able to go out to the gate and greet your arriving passengers.  Nice shot.  Looks like a brochure photo for the airport. :)', '2010-03-28 09:43:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5919622, 862566, 15711, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective.  It has a nice architecture to it. I''m kind of wishing that the wing had sky above our view as well.... maybe not. :)</td>', 'Interesting perspective.  It has a nice architecture to it. I''m kind of wishing that the wing had sky above our view as well.... maybe not. :)', '2010-03-28 09:44:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5919624, 862488, 15711, '<td valign="top">It makes me think of the plight of the illegal aliens along the Texas border. So many people are up in arms and want to send them all back, but would YOU want to live in Mexico with the way it''s run?  (sorry for the political rant) I like the slightly diagonal line of the tracks and how the three men are gazing at the train, maybe dreaming of getting on and going somewhere better.</td>', 'It makes me think of the plight of the illegal aliens along the Texas border. So many people are up in arms and want to send them all back, but would YOU want to live in Mexico with the way it''s run?  (sorry for the political rant) I like the slightly diagonal line of the tracks and how the three men are gazing at the train, maybe dreaming of getting on and going somewhere better.', '2010-03-28 09:46:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5919627, 862313, 15711, '<td valign="top">Oh that''s a great motion blur shot. I love the symmetry and how the yellow stripes oppose one another.  I wonder if you had done a selective color adjustment and removed the black from the yellow, for more pop.  Just talking out loud.I like the single person in the distance.  I didn''t even see him until a 2nd thorough look. :)</td>', 'Oh that''s a great motion blur shot. I love the symmetry and how the yellow stripes oppose one another.  I wonder if you had done a selective color adjustment and removed the black from the yellow, for more pop.  Just talking out loud.I like the single person in the distance.  I didn''t even see him until a 2nd thorough look. :)', '2010-03-28 09:47:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5919629, 862214, 15711, '<td valign="top">GOOD LORD!!  Looks like target practice. LOL</td>', 'GOOD LORD!!  Looks like target practice. LOL', '2010-03-28 09:48:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5919631, 862286, 15711, '<td valign="top">When I first saw the title, I thought it said Cleopatra!  LOL  I had to look it up.  Aren''t you clever to use the genus name.  I learned to drive stick shift on a 1964.  I have a warm fuzzy feeling for these guys.</td>', 'When I first saw the title, I thought it said Cleopatra!  LOL  I had to look it up.  Aren''t you clever to use the genus name.  I learned to drive stick shift on a 1964.  I have a warm fuzzy feeling for these guys.', '2010-03-28 09:49:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5919632, 862097, 15711, '<td valign="top">Every time I see scenes like this, I think in my head, the conductor yelling "ALL ABOARD!!"</td>', 'Every time I see scenes like this, I think in my head, the conductor yelling "ALL ABOARD!!"', '2010-03-28 09:50:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5919634, 862323, 15711, '<td valign="top">This made me smile.  My now almost 15 year old used to line up everything.  He''d put Cheerios across his little high chair''s tray table in perfect alignment, and of course his brother''s outgrown Hot Wheels.  He of course, acquired some of his own, but I''d smile when he''d do his linear thing with the beloved little cars.  Thanks for the nostalgic image.</td>', 'This made me smile.  My now almost 15 year old used to line up everything.  He''d put Cheerios across his little high chair''s tray table in perfect alignment, and of course his brother''s outgrown Hot Wheels.  He of course, acquired some of his own, but I''d smile when he''d do his linear thing with the beloved little cars.  Thanks for the nostalgic image.', '2010-03-28 09:51:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5919635, 862646, 15711, '<td valign="top">Love the flare. :)</td>', 'Love the flare. :)', '2010-03-28 09:52:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5919636, 862450, 15711, '<td valign="top">UGH - we see too many signs like that on trucks here in Texas.  This old beast is terrific. I like the symmetry of it.  Man, that paint is crackled isn''t it?</td>', 'UGH - we see too many signs like that on trucks here in Texas.  This old beast is terrific. I like the symmetry of it.  Man, that paint is crackled isn''t it?', '2010-03-28 09:52:51.000000', NULL, 1),
