(5920601, 861997, 69008, '<td valign="top">I had an engine modeled after this in my train set when I was a kid, with the same Union Pacific color scheme and logo. Thanks for the memory jog.  <br/>It''s a good utility photo, but the white sky is going to dink the score.</td>', 'I had an engine modeled after this in my train set when I was a kid, with the same Union Pacific color scheme and logo. Thanks for the memory jog.  It''s a good utility photo, but the white sky is going to dink the score.', '2010-03-29 02:08:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5921193, 862214, 114429, '<td valign="top">Okay, okay, my high score is a little biased, only because I love desert photos and old rusty things. Otherwise, cool shot of it''s own merits of course. I really like the plateu''s/mtns in the background. It really gives you a sense of the solitude of this trucks surroundings.</td>', 'Okay, okay, my high score is a little biased, only because I love desert photos and old rusty things. Otherwise, cool shot of it''s own merits of course. I really like the plateu''s/mtns in the background. It really gives you a sense of the solitude of this trucks surroundings.', '2010-03-29 13:19:16.000000', NULL, 1),
