(5922306, 862603, 106543, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to see the entire front of the train in the picture. Maybe a few steps back?</td>', 'I would have liked to see the entire front of the train in the picture. Maybe a few steps back?', '2010-03-30 13:55:01.000000', NULL, 1),
