(5922402, 862672, 5364, '<td valign="top">Here''s my comments (because you put the CW in the title)<br/> <br/>If I was voting on this challenge, I would have given you a 6. I like your composition especially how you''ve framed the flying boat with the foreground aircraft. My one minor issue is that I feel you could have cropped off the right hand edge slightly to loose the wing-root so that distraction was removed.</td>', 'Here''s my comments (because you put the CW in the title) If I was voting on this challenge, I would have given you a 6. I like your composition especially how you''ve framed the flying boat with the foreground aircraft. My one minor issue is that I feel you could have cropped off the right hand edge slightly to loose the wing-root so that distraction was removed.', '2010-03-30 16:03:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5922406, 862603, 5364, '<td valign="top">Here''s my comments specifically because you''ve marked it CW<br/> <br/>If I was voting in this challenge I would have given it a 5. While I feel it''s an OK photo, the composition doesn''t grab me. I''m torn between thinking it''s too tight a crop (I want to see all of the train), or not tight enough (more of an abstract). I also wonder if you could have made it look more imposing by taking the picture from a lower angle.</td>', 'Here''s my comments specifically because you''ve marked it CW If I was voting in this challenge I would have given it a 5. While I feel it''s an OK photo, the composition doesn''t grab me. I''m torn between thinking it''s too tight a crop (I want to see all of the train), or not tight enough (more of an abstract). I also wonder if you could have made it look more imposing by taking the picture from a lower angle.', '2010-03-30 16:13:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5922408, 862374, 5364, '<td valign="top">Here''s my comments specifically because you''ve marked it CW.<br/> <br/>If I was voting in this challenge I would have given you a 5. I like your subject and you''ve managed to capture it mostly isolated from a potentially distracting background, but not quite. I feel the car behind and especially the orange in the background is a little too distracting.</td>', 'Here''s my comments specifically because you''ve marked it CW. If I was voting in this challenge I would have given you a 5. I like your subject and you''ve managed to capture it mostly isolated from a potentially distracting background, but not quite. I feel the car behind and especially the orange in the background is a little too distracting.', '2010-03-30 16:17:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5922418, 862428, 30861, '<td valign="top">LOL for the title :-)</td>', 'LOL for the title :-)', '2010-03-30 16:29:03.000000', NULL, 1),
