(5923022, 862189, 49865, '<td valign="top">This image stopped me in my tracks during voting. Glad to see it take the blue.<br/> <br/>[ edit ] On a side note, I get really disappointed when people don''t allow themselves to enjoy an image because they are too busy searching for technical flaws or violation of compositional conventions. I honestly didn''t even notice the blown out clouds until I read your description and struggle even now to figure out how they diminish the visual impact of this image. I do not typically think of the cabin of a commercial airliner as an enviable photographic destination!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2010-03-31 02:31:26.</i></td>', 'This image stopped me in my tracks during voting. Glad to see it take the blue. [ edit ] On a side note, I get really disappointed when people don''t allow themselves to enjoy an image because they are too busy searching for technical flaws or violation of compositional conventions. I honestly didn''t even notice the blown out clouds until I read your description and struggle even now to figure out how they diminish the visual impact of this image. I do not typically think of the cabin of a commercial airliner as an enviable photographic destination!', '2010-03-31 03:21:13.000000', '2010-03-31 03:31:26.000000', 0),
