(5923334, 861459, 30049, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by jonkster:</b></div><hr/><i> the photo captures the size of the aircraft against that of the towering cumulus but I reckon it would be even better if the aircraft was not centred in the frame.  Still I like it. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>I gave this photo a 9 because it was a strong entry for me, however I do agree with the above comment.  Overall, nicely seen and captured IMO!  :-)</td>', 'Originally posted by jonkster: the photo captures the size of the aircraft against that of the towering cumulus but I reckon it would be even better if the aircraft was not centred in the frame.  Still I like it.  I gave this photo a 9 because it was a strong entry for me, however I do agree with the above comment.  Overall, nicely seen and captured IMO!  :-)', '2010-03-31 09:57:22.000000', NULL, 0),
